    "Titles": {
        "eng": "I'm The Blade Master",
        "jpn": null
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "In the midst of a conspiracy within the martial arts world, the Supreme Blade Master is killed, and the leaders of various sects either perish or are imprisoned, plunging the martial arts community into chaos. To restore order, Yan Jiyu, the head of the Tingyun Academy, sends envoys to the major sects, aiming to establish a new martial arts order under his leadership, emphasizing \"righteousness.\" Meanwhile, Yang Ren, a young and inexperienced martial artist, is entrusted with delivering a letter left by the Blade Master. On his perilous journey, surrounded by powerful enemies, Yang Ren relies on his passion and sense of justice to continually surpass himself, defeating his opponents. As his martial arts skills advance rapidly, he also befriends a group of honorable and chivalrous individuals. The fate of the martial arts world remains uncertain...",
        "jpn": null
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "I Am the Daoist Master of Swords"
    ],
